### Local environment ###
# Credentials for docker compose / local runs — never commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
# Everything under .idea/ is per-developer or holds credentials
# (dataSources.local.xml stores database passwords), with two exceptions: the
# style config is shared, because it is the only thing enforcing the Google
# Java Style the assignment requires — Gradle has no lint task.
#
# .idea/* rather than .idea/: an excluded directory cannot be selectively
# re-included, because git does not descend into it to find the exception.
.idea/*
!.idea/checkstyle-idea.xml
!.idea/google-java-format.xml
# Module files are regenerated by the Gradle import.
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

### Build output ###
build/
.gradle/
out/

